The Church of Our Lady Mary of Zion has been destroyed and rebuilt several times. It was originally constructed in the 4 th century by the Ethiopian Orthodox Church, believed to be during the reign of King Ezana the first Christian ruler of Axum, and claims to contain the Ark of the Covenant. It is located in Tigray Ethiopia.
